-- examples/checks/cost-shapes-model.rofl — THE COSTLY-SHAPE LINT OVER THE JS MODEL.
-- examples/shapes/shapes.rofl over the reflection of the rules of the model (MODEL_FILES of
-- notebook/front.ts), with the register facts/cost-shapes.rofl. Green means every finding is
-- either absent or excused with the measurement that excuses it; a rule written the costly way
-- turns the world red (`shape_alarm`), and so does a register row whose finding has gone
-- (`shape_ok_stale`), so an excuse does not outlive the rule it excused.
alarm(shape_alarm).
alarm(shape_ok_stale).
